<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">Sakachep: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">1 Korinth</para>
  <para style="toc1">KORINTH Mingei kôma Paul Lekhamuthuon Inkhatna</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Korinth</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Kor</para>
  <para style="mt1">KORINTH</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mingei Kôma Paul Lekhamuthuon Inkhatna</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chongmaruoi</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Korinth mingei kôma tîrton Paul lekhamuthuon inkhatna hi,</char> Paul'n Korinth taka koiindang a phun sûnga Khristienngei ringnuna le an taksônna chungroia intaknangei ahônbôk minthâr puina ranga miziek ani. Ma zora lâihan Korinth hih jâttin rûitin omna Greek khopuilien, Achaia rama Roman ramhuola khopuilientak munpuitak ani. Sadâithona lam tieng asân ariming ânthanga, jâtlenam zie insongna, nunchan saloina tieng le sakhuo biek jât dadang tamna tienga ariming ânthang ani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul'n a inveinangei lientak chu intaknangei, koiindang sûnga insennangei, hur le ngal, inneina roia chongrekelngei, sielesarietna roi ngei, koiindang chongpêkngei, Ratha Inthieng neinunpêkngei le inthoinôkna roi ngei hih ani. Thîrna inthûktakin, ha chongrekelngei chunga Thurchi Sa ti lam angin a minlang pe ngei ani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bung 13 na, hin lungkhamna hi a mingei kôma Pathien manboipêk satak ani ti ânlanga, ma anghan hi bung hih a lekhabu sûnga ânlâr tak khom ani.</para>
  <para style="is1">Asûnga chongtângpuingei</para>
  <para style="io1">Chongmaruoi <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 1:1-9">1:1-9</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Koiindanga pâlinsenangei <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 1:10-4:21">1:10—4:21</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Inditnasaloi le insungkuo ringnun <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 5:1-7:40">5:1—7:40</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khristienngei le sonongngei <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 8:1-11:1">8:1—11:1</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Koiindang ringnun le biekna <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 11:2-14:40">11:2—14:40</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khrista le iempungei inthoinôkna <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 15:1-58">15:1-58</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Judea rama khristienngei ranga chôiruol <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 16:1-4">16:1-4</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Misang roingei le chongkhârna <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 16:5-24">16:5-24</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1"/>Paul renga, Pathien lungdoa Khrista Jisua tîrton ni ranga koi le ei lâibungpa Sosthenes han,<verse eid="1CO 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2"/>Korinth taka Pathien koiindang aom, Pathien mi inthieng ni ranga koi ngei, Khrista Jisua leh inzoma ama ta, muntina ei Pumapa Jisua Khrista biek mi murdi ngei leh munkhatin, an Pumapa le ei Pumapa kôm:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:1">Sin 18:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3"/>Pathien ei Pa le Pumapa Jisua Khrista kôm renga moroina le inngêina nin kôm om rese.<verse eid="1CO 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista taka satvurnangei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4"/>Khrista Jisua Pathien'n moroina nangni a pêk sikin nin ta rangin Pathien kôm râisânchong ki misîr bang ngâi. <verse eid="1CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5"/>Ama renga lam tina minei nin nia, chong le rietnangeia nin insôn bang sikin. <verse eid="1CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6"/>Khrista chong hah nin kôma mindetin aoma <verse eid="1CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7"/>ei Pumapa Jisua Khrista inlâr rang nin ngâk angin a satvurnangei inkhat luo man loiin om mak chei. <verse eid="1CO 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8"/>Ei Pumapa Jisua Khrista Nikhuo han khom châinaboia nin omna rangin a kôm han among dênin nangni mindet atih. <verse eid="1CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9"/>A Nâipasal Jisua Khrista, ei Pumapa leh inlopna dôn ranga nangni koipu Pathien hah taksôn aom ani.<verse eid="1CO 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Koiindang sûnga insennangei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10"/>Ka lâibungngei le sarnungei, nin tina murdia inruola, nin lâia insenna reng om loia, mulungrîl munkhat leh mindonna munkhat dôna om rangin ei Pumapa Jisua Khrista rimingin nin rêngin nangni ke ngên. <verse eid="1CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11"/>Ku sûngsuokngei, nin lâia inkhalna aom ti Khloe insûngmi senkhatngeiin ânthârlakin min ril. <verse eid="1CO 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12"/>Ma anghin lei ti rong: nin rêngin nin ti lam atei chita, senkhatin an ti “Kei chu Paul pâl ki ni”; “Kei chu Apollos pâl ki ni”; adangin “Kei chu Peter pâl ki ni”; male adangin “Kei chu Khrista pâl ki ni” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:24">Sin 18:24</ref></char></note> nin tia. <verse eid="1CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13"/>Khrista chu pâlngeiin semin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13; </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khrista hah semin aom mo; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngeiin an dôn chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khrista hah sem thei nimak.</char></note> aom mo! Nin ta ranga khrosa thipu hah Paul mini? aninônchu tîrton Paul riminga baptis chang mo nin ni?<verse eid="1CO 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14"/>Krispus le Gaius tiloiin chu tute ka baptis loi sikin Pathien kôm râisânchong ki ril. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:8">Sin 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:29">19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:23">Rom 16:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15"/>Masikin, tutên ku ruoisingei rimingin baptis ka chang ti thei no tunui. <verse eid="1CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16"/>(O ani, Stephanas le a insûngmingei khom baptis ko thoa, midang ka baptis sa mo khom riet mu-ung.) <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:15">1 Kor 16:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17"/>Khrista'n baptis rangin mi tîr maka, Thurchi Sa misîra, ma thurchisa hah miriem vârna mang loia misîr rangin mi tîr kêng ani, Khrosa Khrista thina hah asênaboi achang loina rangin.<verse eid="1CO 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista sinthotheina le Pathien vârna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18"/>Khrosa Khrista thina roi hih ânmang tir ngei ta rangin chu mona ania, aniatachu eini sanminring tira omngei ta rangin chu Pathien sinthotheina ani. <verse eid="1CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19"/>Pathien lekhabu'n:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 29:14">Isa 29:14</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">“Mivâr vârna chu min boi riei ka ta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 1:19">male mitheingei riettheina chu paivar ki tih,” ati.<verse eid="1CO 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20"/>Hanchu, mivârngei hah khonmo an om? mitheingei hah khonmo an om? Hi rammuola mi makhal theitakngei hah khonmo an om? Pathien'n hi rammuol vârna hih mona ani ti a minlang zoi!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:17">Job 12:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 19:12">Isa 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 33:18">33:18</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:25">Isa 44:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21"/>Miriemngeiin an vârna mangin Pathien an riet thei khâiloi lehan Pathien vârna thurchi misîr “inmôl tak” manga a iemngei sanminring hah Pathien lungdo tak ani. <verse eid="1CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22"/>Judangeiin minthârna rangin sininkhêlngei an zonga, Greekngeiin vârna an zong. <verse eid="1CO 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23"/>Keini rêkin chu Khrista jêmdelna roi kin misîr ngâia, mahah Judangei ta rangin chu inpalna ania, Jentailngei ta rangin mona ani; <verse eid="1CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24"/>aniatachu Juda mo, Greek mo Pathien'n a koingei ta rangin chu Khrista hah Pathien sinthotheina le Pathien vârna ani. <verse eid="1CO 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25"/>Pathien inmôlna chu miriem vârna nêkin avâr uola, a râtloina khom miriem râtna nêkin arât uol sikin.<verse eid="1CO 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26"/>Ka lâibungngei le sarnungei atûn, nangni a koi lam hih mindon ta u, nin lâia mi tamtak hi taksa tienga mivâr nimak choia, mi sinthotheitak khom nimak choia, mi roiinpui lâia khom nimak choi. <verse eid="1CO 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27"/>Pathien'n mivârngei mâimôkashak theina rangin rammuol mindonna inmôlngei a thang ngeia, mirâtngei mâimôkashak theina rangin rammuol mindonna mi dok ngei a thang zoi. <verse eid="1CO 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28"/>Mapên han Pathien'n rammuol mindonna neinun kâm omngei hah kâmnângloi a min chang theina rangin rammuolin a en nuomloia amintem le itea abe loi hah a thang sa zoi. <verse eid="1CO 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29"/>Masikin Pathien makunga han tute omlien song thei om noni ngei. <verse eid="1CO 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30"/>Aniatachu nangni chu Pathien'n Khrista Jisua le nangni minzomin, Khrista hah ei vârna rangin a sin ani. Ama jârin Pathien makunga midik ei changa, Pathien mi inthieng ngei ei hongnia mojôkin ei om zoi. <verse eid="1CO 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31"/>Masikin Pathien lekhabu'n ati anghan, “Tukhom insong rang ajôt ngei chu Pumapa sintho hih song ngêt rese ngei.” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:24">Jer 9:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2"/>
  <para style="s">Khrista jêmdela aom roi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1"/>Ka lâibungngei le sarnungei, Pathien chongtak inthup,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1; </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pathien chongtak inthup; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngei an chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pathien chungroi.</char></note> misîra nin lâia ko hong lâihan, chong roiinpui le rietna roiinpui mang mu-ung. <verse eid="1CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2"/>Nin lâia ko om han khom neinun dang murdi mingil riein Jisua Khrista jêmdela aom roi vai kêng nin riet rang ku nuom ngâi. <verse eid="1CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3"/>Ma anghan nin lâia han râtloi le innîk pumin leh ichin ko oma,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:9">Sin 18:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4"/>male ka bâi renga minchuna chong asuok le ku thurchi misîr ngei khom hah miriem vârna methêmna chong nimaka, Pathien Ratha sinthotheina chong kêng ani uol. <verse eid="1CO 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5"/>Masikin nin taksônna hah miriem vârna han inngam maka, Pathien sinthotheina han kêng ânngam ani.<verse eid="1CO 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pathien vârna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6"/>Hannoma rathatienga mitungsuo ngei kôm chu vârna chong ki misîr ngâi. Hannirese hi rammuol vârna chong chu nimaka, hi rammuol roijêkpungei an inlalna ânmang tir ngei vârna chong khom nimak. <verse eid="1CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7"/>Pathien vârna chong inthup ha kêng ki misîr ngâi, vârna chong inthup ei roiinpuina ranga Pathien'n rammuol om mânna a lei thangsai hah kêng ani. <verse eid="1CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8"/>Ma vârna hah hi rammuol roijêkpungei rengin riet mak ngei. Riet senla ngei chu roiinpuina Pumapa hah jêmdel noni ngei. <verse eid="1CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9"/>Hannoma Pathien lekhabu'n,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 64:4">Isa 64:4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">“Tutên an mu ngâiloi le an riet ngâiloi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">Ma anga tung ranga tutên an mindon loi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">Pathien'n a lungkham ngei ta ranga a mintuosai ngân chu,” ati anghan.<verse eid="1CO 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10"/>Aniatachu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Aniatachu; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngei an dôn chu. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rang.</char></note> Pathien'n eini rangin chu a chongtak inthup hah Ratha'n mi min riet zoi. Ratha han jâttin a sûisuok ngâi, Pathien neinunkhînngei inthûktaka inthup khom. <verse eid="1CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11"/>Ei sûnga om ei ratha lelê hih vai kêng ei chungroi a riet ngâia; ma angdên han, Pathien Ratha vai kêng Pathien chungroi murdi a riet thei ngâi. <verse eid="1CO 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12"/>Ei man hih rammuol Ratha nimaka; manêkin, Pathien'n neinun mi pêk ngei murdi ei riet theina rangin, Pathien juongtîr Ratha ha kêng ei man ani.<verse eid="1CO 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13"/>Masika han miriem vârna minchûn, misîr ngâi mak mea, Ratha minchûn kêng kin misîr ngâi, rathatienga chongtakngei hah Ratha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ratha dôn ngei chu; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ratha chongpêk ngei leh.</char></note> dônngei kôm kin rilsensâi ngâi. <verse eid="1CO 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14"/>Tukhom Ratha dôn loiin chu Pathien Ratha renga manboipêkngei hah man thei ngâi mak ngei. Ma anga mingei han chu ma neinunngei hah riet thei ngâi mak ngeia; ama ta rangin chu inmôlna vai kêng ani, a luttie hah Ratha'n vai kêng a riet thei sikin. <verse eid="1CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15"/>Tutu khom Ratha man ngei chu neinuntin aluttie an riet ngâi, hannirese, ama chu tutên jêk thei ngâi mak ngei. <verse eid="1CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16"/>Pathien lekhabu'n ati anghan:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Isa 40:13</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">“Tu'n mo Pumapa mulungrîl a riet?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:16">Tu mo minchuna chong a pêk thei rang?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Nikhomrese, einin chu Khrista mulungbôk ei pêl ani.<verse eid="1CO 2:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3"/>
  <para style="s">Pathien tîrlâmngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1"/>Ka lâibungngei le sarnungei, ratha mingei kôma ki misîr angin nin kôm thurchi misîr thei mu-unga; hi rammuol mi, khrista taksônna tieng nâitengei kôma misîr angin kêng nangni ki misîr pe. <verse eid="1CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2"/>Burum niloiin, runutuiin nangni ka vâi ani hi, bu nin la nêk theiloi sikin. Male atûn khom la nêk theiloi dên nin nia,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 5:12">Heb 5:12</ref>,<ref loc="HEB 5:13">13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3"/>rammuol mingei om anghan nin la om tit sikin. Nin lâia innarsana le inkhat le inkhat inkhalna aom kâr chu rammuol ta nin ni tiin minlangin aoma, anni angdêna la om nin ni tina nimak mo? <verse eid="1CO 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4"/>Nin lâia, “Kei chu Paul pâl ki ni,” a dangin “Kei chu Apollos pâl ki ni,” ti ngei nin la om kâr chu rammuol mingei angin nan la om bang nimak mo?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:12">1 Kor 1:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5"/>Apollos hah tumo ani? Paul khom tumo ani? Pathien tîrlâmngei, nin iem theina ranga sinthopu papai kêng kin ni. Pathien'n tho rang mi pêk chit kêng kin sin: <verse eid="1CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6"/>Keiman chimu ker thea, Apollos'n tui a buoka, aniatachu chimukung a minsônpu chu Pathien ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:4-11">Sin 18:4-11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:24-28">Sin 18:24-28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7"/>A minsônpu Pathien ni loiin chu chimu rethepu le tui buokpu hah ite nimak ngei. <verse eid="1CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8"/>A lingpu le tui buokpu hah ite an teina om mak. An sintho lam angtakin Pathien'n râisânman pêk ngei atih. <verse eid="1CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9"/>Pathien ta ranga munkhata sintho kin nia, nangni hih Pathien loimân nin ni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 3:9">Pathien in nin ni sa. <verse eid="1CO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10"/>Pathien'n manboipêk ni pêk mangin in sinpu theitak angin keiman lungphûm ku phûma, midangin in an sin ani. Aniatachu mitinin an sin rang lam angtakin indîn thei rese ngei. <verse eid="1CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11"/>Pathien lungphûm a lei phûm sai Jisua Khrista pêna chu tutên lungphûm dang phûm thei noni ngei. <verse eid="1CO 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12"/>Ma lungphûm chunga han senkhatin rângkachakin mini, sumdârin mini, lung mantam mini mangin sin an ta; senkhatin thingin mini, sûlbuon mini, sapôl mini mangin sin an tih. <verse eid="1CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13"/>Khrista Nikhuo han meiin ânlâr rang sikin mei ngêt han mitin sintho hah phuol a ta; anina tak inlang atih. <verse eid="1CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14"/>Lungphûm chunga sin hah akâng nônchu a sinpu'n râisânman man atih. <verse eid="1CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15"/>Aniatachu tutu sintho khom akângin chu dok atih; hannirese, ama ha chu mei rakân angdôrin sanminjôkin om atih.<verse eid="1CO 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16"/>Pathien in nin ni le Pathien Ratha nin kôma aom ngâi ti nin riet minthâr khet mo?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:19">1 Kor 6:19</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:16">2 Kor 6:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17"/>Masikin tutu khom Pathien biekin hah a sietin chu Pathien'n ama hah siet atih. Pathien biekin chu ânthieng kêng, male nangni ngei hah a biekin nin ni.<verse eid="1CO 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18"/>Tutên athenin inhuong no rese. Nin lâia tutu khom hi rammuol balama avârin ân bên chu a vâr tatak theina rangin amo chang bak rese. <verse eid="1CO 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19"/>Hi rammuolin vârna ati hih Pathien mitmûn chu achâng ani sikin, Pathien lekhabu'n, “Pathien'n mivârngei chu kin vâr an intina han a min ôk ngei ngâi,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:13">Job 5:13</ref></char></note> ati anghan; <verse eid="1CO 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20"/>male Pathien lekhabu dangin, “Pumapa'n chu mivârngei mindonna hah mangmunboi ani ti a riet,” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 94:11">Lap 94:11</ref></char></note> ati sa anghan. <verse eid="1CO 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21"/>Masika han tutên miriemngei song no rese ngei. Adikin chu neinun nâm nin ta ani: <verse eid="1CO 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22"/>Paul khom, Apollos khom, Peter khom; hi rammuol khom, ringna le thina khom, neinun omsai le ala hong om rang ngei khom anrêngin nin ta riempet an ni, <verse eid="1CO 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23"/>male nangni khom Khrista ta nin nia, Khrista khom Pathien ta ani.<verse eid="1CO 3:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4"/>
  <para style="s">Khrista Tîrtonngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1"/>Keini hih Khrista tîrlâmngei, le Pathien chongtak inthup donsûipungeiin mi mindon roi. <verse eid="1CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2"/>Hi taka neinun ankhat anâng chu tîrlâmngei hah an pu mitmua mi taksônom an ni rang ani. <verse eid="1CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3"/>Atûn nangnin mi nin jêkna le miriem mindonna balama mi nin jêkna hah kei rangin chu itên bê mu-ung; Ke thenin khom ko roijêk ngâi mu-ung. <verse eid="1CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4"/>Ki sielesarietna chu ânthâr, hannirese mahan keima sietnaboi ki ni tatak inthârna om uol mak. Pumapa hah ku chunga roijêkpu chu ani. <verse eid="1CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5"/>Masikin Pumapa juong nôk mâka chu azora diktak motona roi lei jêkmasat lai no roi. Azoina roijêkna chu Pumapa juong rang ngâk ngêt nîng a ta; ama'n ijînga inthup ngei hah avâra hong kêlsuong a ta, miriem mulungrîla bôkna inthup ngei khom minlang sâng atih. Male mitinin minpâkna an chang rang dôr Pathien renga an khôk rang ani.<verse eid="1CO 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6"/>Ka lâibungngei le sarnungei, “Balamngei hih jôm roi,” ti hi nin inchu theina rangin keima le Apollos hih nin enton rangin ko hong târminlang ani, tutên mi inkhat songin midang enkhûm no roi. <verse eid="1CO 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7"/>Tumo midang chunga ulienin nangni sin? Neinuntin nin man ngei hah Pathien'n nangni a pêk nimak mo? Asa, nin man anînte ithomo manboipêk aman loi angin omlien nin songa?<verse eid="1CO 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8"/>Nin nâng ngei murdi nin dôn zoi mo? Nin nei mo ani zoi? Kin om nonnom rêngngei nin chang thei mo ani zoi? Asa, rêngngei chang thei tatak ungla ku nuom ani, hanke nangni leh munkhata rêngngei ei chang thei rang. <verse eid="1CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9"/>Pathien'n keini tîrtonngei hih thi ranga inkhâm anga anûktaka mi tîrsuokin kin bê ani; rammuol le vântîrtonngei le miriemngei mitmua enhoia sinin kin om sika hin. <verse eid="1CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10"/>Keini chu Khrista jârin amo kin ni; aniatachu nangni chu Khrista jârin mivâr nin ni! Keini chu kin doka, hannirese nangni chu nin rât! keini chu mingeiin min enkhûma, nangni chu mirit nangni an tho! <verse eid="1CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11"/>Atûn ten vonchâm le tui inrâlin kin oma; rovo chetin kin invoa; mi tôkmol kin tuonga; ommun invâiin kin chai titir ani; <verse eid="1CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12"/>Kin kuta sinthôn dûktong takin kin invâi ani. Mîn khomâk min sâm khomin sat kin vur ngâia; dûk min mintong khomin diertakin kan tuonga;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:3">Sin 18:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13"/>Mi min êro khomin chong dâiriemin kin thuon ngâi. Hi rammuola ronok leh tei uol khâi mak meh; hi zora ten khom hin rammuola pornôngkok angin kin ni.<verse eid="1CO 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14"/>Hi chong ki miziek hih nin inzakpuina ranga ki ti niloiin, Ka nâi moroi ngei angin nangni minchu ku nuom sika ani. <verse eid="1CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15"/>Khristien ringnuna enkolpu isâng sôm dôn khom ungla, Pa chu inkhat vai kêng nin dôn. Nan lâia Thurchi Sa hong mintunga Khrista Jisua leh inzoma nin ringna han nin pa ko hongni ani. <verse eid="1CO 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16"/>Masikin keima ku nunchan jûi rangin nangni ke ngên.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:1">1 Kor 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:17">Phili 3:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17"/>Hi chungroia hin Timothy, khristien ringnun jâra ka nâipasal moroi le taksônom hih nin kôm ko hongtîr. Ama'n Khrista leh inzomin ringna thara ku nunchan muntina koiindangngei murdi ki minchu ngâi anghan nangni min riet nôk atih.<verse eid="1CO 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18"/>Nin lâia ko hong khâi loi rang mini ti nin bôk sikin, mi senkhatin chu omlien nan song ani. <verse eid="1CO 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19"/>Nikhomrese, Pumapa'n asa a tiin chu nan lâia hong lai ki tih, Hanchu hi mi ânsong ngei hih an mûrra an ti vai niloiin, sinthotheina an dôn khom mu thei ki ti zoi. <verse eid="1CO 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20"/>Pathien Rêngram chu chongbâingei vaia om niloiin sinthotheinân aom kêng ani uol. <verse eid="1CO 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21"/>Imo nin nuom uol? Tôkmol leh mo nin kôm ku juong rang, aninônchu ratha lungkhamna le nuninnêmin mo?<verse eid="1CO 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5"/>
  <para style="s">Koiindang lâia inditnasaloi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1"/>Atûn, nin lâia inditnasaloi aom ti mîn an hong misîr baka, ma-angdôra inditnasaloi ha chu sonongngei lâia luo om ngâi mak. Mi inkhatin a puingâk a jâlpui ngâi ti khom min lei ril ani!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 22:30">Bal 22:30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2"/>Hanchu, kho angin mo nin lân song bang theia? Ânsong nêkin, Ma anga saloi thopu ha chu nin inzomkhômna renga nin rujûlpai theina rangin kângdoinân nin sip uol rang ani. <verse eid="1CO 5:2"/><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3-4"/>Nin lâia taksan inchel thei no khom ronga ratha'n chu kên chel ani; nan lâia om anghan ei Pumapa Jisua rimingin ma angtaka saloi ichi om thopu chunga han roi ke jêkmasat zoi. Nangni le keima ratha Pumapa Jisua sinthotheinân intûpin, <verse eid="1CO 5:3-4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5"/>ha miriem hah Pumapa Nikhuoa han a ratha sanminring ani theina rangin Soitan kuta a takpum minmang rangin nin pêk rang ani.<verse eid="1CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6"/>Nin inpâk rang hi dik mak! “Chol tômtên vâipôl bil pumpui amin thoizit ngâi,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:9">Gal 5:9</ref></char></note> ti nin riet nimak mo? <verse eid="1CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:5">Jôk 12:5</ref></char></note> Chol koploi vâipôl bil nin nia, vâipôl tang atharzek nin ni theina rangin sietna chol muruo hah khâipai roi. Atûn, ei Kalkân Kût Khohoi thona rang Khrista, ei Kalkân Kût belrite hah, inbôlnân pêkin aom zoi sikin. <verse eid="1CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:7">Jôk 13:7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:3">Bal 16:3</ref></char></note> Masikin ei Kalkân khohoi mang ei ti u, Chol muruo puoloina le sietna kop vâipôl niloiin cholboi inthiengna le chongtak vâipôl leh mang ei ti u.<verse eid="1CO 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9"/>Ke lekhamuthuon han inditnasaloi song mingei leh inlop loi rangin nangni ki tia. <verse eid="1CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10"/>Sonongngei inditnasaloi song ngei mini, tamrâival ngei mini, inrungei mini le mirmil biekngei mini inloppui tet no roi ki ti nimaka, ma anghan nisenla chu rammuol hih nin mâkving rang anâng rang ani. <verse eid="1CO 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11"/>Ki ti tak chu tutu khom iempu intia, inditnasaloi song mini, tamrâival mini, mirmil biek mini, inngo song mini, ju inrûi mini, inru mini ala thopu chu inloppui no roi ti hih ani. Ma anga mingei lehan chu insungin nêk le sâk khom thopui no roi.<verse eid="1CO 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12-13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12-13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 13:5">Bal 13:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 17:7">17:7</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note> Keiman pêntienga mingei roi ke jêk rang nâng mak. Pathien'n jêk ngei atih. Hannirese nin lôm kâra mi chu nin jêk rang nimak mo? Pathien lekhabu'n, “Mi saloi hah nin pâl renga khâipai roi,” ati anghan.<verse eid="1CO 5:12-13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6"/>
  <para style="s">Khristien champuingei leh insûkloina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1"/>Nin lâia tumakhatin a Khristien champui leh insûkloina dôn senla, ma insûkloina roi hah jêk rangin Pathien mingei kôm mintung loiin sonong roijêkpungei kôm a mintung ngam rang mo? <verse eid="1CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2"/>Pathien mingeiin rammuol roijêk an tih, ti nin riet loi mo? Rammuol roi luo mana nin la jêk rang anînte, roi achînte jêk rang hi nin jêk thei loi mo? <verse eid="1CO 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3"/>Vântîrtonngei khom ei la jêk ngei rang anni ti nin riet loi mo? Hi damsûng roi vâng chu ti rang luo nâng mak. <verse eid="1CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4"/>Ma anghan damsûng roijêk rang ahong om duoiin chu, koiindanga itea tel bâkloi mingei nin min jêk rang mo? <verse eid="1CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5"/>Nin inzakna ranga ki ti ani! Nin Khristien champuingei lâia roi injêl jêk thei mivâr inkhat luo nin om loi mo? <verse eid="1CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6"/>Manêkin, khristien ankhatin a sûngsuok leh an insûkloina roijêkna mintungin sonongngei a man jêk ngâi hi!<verse eid="1CO 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7"/>Roi injêl nin dôn ngâi sika hin chukloina tak nin dôn ti chu ânlang ani. Tho minchâia aom hah nin ta rangin asa uol nimak mo? Muruka aom hah nan ta rangin asa uol nimak mo? <verse eid="1CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8"/>Manêkin nangni rengin nin tho minchâi inlôm ngâia, nin inru inlôm ngâi, nin lâibungngei le nin sarnungei lelê leh khom! <verse eid="1CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9"/>Adiktakin mipuoloi ngeiin Pathien Rêngram luo noni ngei ti nin riet loi mo? Nin thethenin inhuong no roi; inditnasaloi song ngei, mirmil biekngei, inrêngei, hurngei, pinkuohurngei <verse eid="1CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10"/>aninônchu inrungei, tamrâivalngei, ju inrûingei, inngo song ngei, murukmeret tho ngei hin Pathien Rêngram luo tet noni ngei. <verse eid="1CO 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11"/>Nangni khom senkhat chu ma anga mi nin lei ni ngâi. Aniatachu, sietna renga rusûk minsâiin Pathien kôm pêk nin ni zoia; ei Pumapa Jisua Khrista le ei Pathien Ratha sikin Pathien kôm adik nin chang zoi.<verse eid="1CO 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pathien roiinpuina rangin nin takpumngei mang roi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12"/>Tumakhatin, “Keima rangin jâttin tho phal ani,” a ti thei. Asa; aniatachu jâttin tho hi nangma rangin sa suolet mak. Jâttin keima rangin tho phal ani ki ti thei, aniatachu ite suokin om no ning.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:23">1 Kor 10:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13"/>Tumakhatin, “Sâk nêk chu von ta rang ania, von chu sâk nêk ta rang ani,” a ti thei. Asa; aniatachu, Pathien'n minboi ruruoi atih. Takpum hih inditnasaloia mang rang nimaka, Pumapa sinthona mang rang kêng ani; male Pumapa'n takpum ranga anângngei a pêk minhun ngâi ani. <verse eid="1CO 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14"/>Pathien'n Pumapa chu thina renga a kaithoia male eini khom a sinthotheinân mi kaithoi sâng atih.<verse eid="1CO 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15"/>Nin takpumngei hah Khrista takpum amachangngei ani ti nin riet. Khrista takpum amachangngei hah lâkpên notizuor ngei takpum amachangin ki minchang rang mo? Ni tet mak! <verse eid="1CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16"/>Notizuor inzompui mi hah chu notizuor leh takpum inkhat an ni ti nin riet loi mo? Pathien lekhabu'n ânthârtakin, “Anruonin takpum inkhat hong nîng an tih,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Aph 2:24</ref></char></note> ati. <verse eid="1CO 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17"/>Aniatachu, Pumapa inzompui mi hah chu ama leh ratha pumkhat an ni.<verse eid="1CO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18"/>Inditnasaloi hih mong ta roi miriemin sietna dang a tho ngei nâm chu a takpum pêntieng ania, inditnasaloi song mi rêk chu ama takpum chunga nunsie a tho ani. <verse eid="1CO 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19"/>Nin takpum hah nin sûnga om Pathien nangni pêk Ratha Inthieng biekin ani ti nin rietloi mo? Nin ta nikhâi mak choia, Pathien ta kêng nin ni;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1 Kor 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:16">2 Kor 6:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20"/>mana rochôk kêng nin ni zoi. Masikin nin takpumngei hah Pathien roiinpuina rangin mang roi.<verse eid="1CO 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7"/>
  <para style="s">Inneina chungroia chongrekelngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1"/>Atûn, nin chong miziek chungroi ngei hah mindonin.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 7:1">Pasal rangin innei loi asa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:1: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pasalin in a nei nônchu a tho min sa; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">pasalin inneiloi rangin asa nin ti ngâi.</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2"/>Aniatachu, inditna tamtak aom ngâi sikin pasalin an theia dôngma dôn chit senla ngeia, nupang khomin an theia ruothar dôn chit rese ngei. <verse eid="1CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3"/>Pasalin a pasal nina sintum a dôngma kôm zoi senla, ma angdênin nupang khomin a pasal kôm a sintum zoi sa senla, an nângna nâma inmathâi inlôm rese ngei. <verse eid="1CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4"/>Nupangin ama takpum chunga han racham nei maka, a pasalin kêng a nei; ma angdênin pasal khomin ama takpum chunga racham nei maka, a dôngman kêng a nei ani. <verse eid="1CO 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5"/>Chubaitho ranga nin inpêk theina rang le nin inmunnôk theina rangin chomoltea rangin asa nin ti ruruoi nônchu nin rachamneina inchu no roi; aninônchu nin indînzoiloina sikin Soitan'n nangni huong i-nih.<verse eid="1CO 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6"/>Hi chong hih chongpêk angin misîr mu-unga, phalna chong angin vai ki misîr ani. <verse eid="1CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7"/>Adiktakin chu nin rêngin keima angin om ungla chu ku nuom ani; aniatachu, mitinin an chang rang chit manboipêk Pathien kôm renga an chang chita, inkhatin lam dang tieng, adangin lam dang tieng.<verse eid="1CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8"/>Atûn, inneiloi ngei le meithâingei rangin chu hi anghin ki ti, Keima angin intîmvielin om rang bôk tit ungla nin ta rangin sa uol atih. <verse eid="1CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9"/>Aniatachu, nin nângna han indîntheina nin dôn nônchu innei roi, hur nêkin chu innei asa uol.<verse eid="1CO 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10"/>Inneisai mingei ta rangin chong ke pêk, ma hih keima renga niloiin, Pumapa chongpêk ani: nupangin a pasal insenpui no rese;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10-11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:9">19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Mk 10:11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11"/>aniatachu ân senpui lekhom pasal dang nei khâi no rese, nônchu a pasal le ngêt inluo nôk rese; male pasal khomin a dôngma mâk tet no rese.<verse eid="1CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12"/>Mi dangngei kôm chu ki ti (keiman, Pumapa niloiin): Khristien pasalin sonong dôngma a neiin chu a dôngma han a kôm om tit rangin a mulung achuk tatakin chu mâk tet no rese. <verse eid="1CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13"/>Male Khristien nupang khomin sonong ruothar a neiin chu a pasal han om kelen rangin a mulung achuk tatakin chu mâk no rese. <verse eid="1CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14"/>Iemloi pasal hah a dôngma jârin Pathien mitmua pomthei ani zoia, iemloi nupang khomin a Khristien pasal jârin Pathien mitmua pomthei ani sa zoi. Ma anghan nino senla chu, an nâingei hah inthieng noni ngei; aniatachu, Pathien mitmua pomthei ani zoi. <verse eid="1CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15"/>Nikhomrese, iemloi inkhat han insen a nuomin chu insen chien rese ngei, ma anga roi hah atokin chu iempu pasal mo, nupang mo, khit nimak ngei. Pathien chu inngêia om rangin nangni a koi ani. <verse eid="1CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16"/>Khristien dôngma na pasal na sanminring<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Na sanminring loi rang inmo ni riet minthâr thei; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Na sanminring rang ha inmo ni riet</char></note> thei rang le thei loi rang kho angin mo ni riet? Aninônchu khristien pasal, no dôngma na sanminring<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Na sanminring loi hah inmo ni riet minthâr ranga; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Na sanminring rang hah inmo ni riet.</char></note> thei rang le thei loi rang kho angin mo ni riet?<verse eid="1CO 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pathien nangni koi anghan om roi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17"/>Tutu khom Pumapa'n manboipêk a pêk lam angtakin le Pathien'n a koi lam angtakin om rese. Hi balam hih koiindang tina ki ril ani. <verse eid="1CO 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18"/>Sertansai mi hah Pathien koina a pomin chu, a sertana sîn hah pai rang a bôk rang nikhâi mak; sertanloi mi khomin Pathien koina a pomin chu, ser a tan rang nikhâi mak. <verse eid="1CO 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19"/>Sertan le tanloi ite ni uol mak; Pathien chongpêkngei jôm hi kêng ani uol tak. <verse eid="1CO 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20"/>Tutu khom Pathien koina a pom lâia an om anghan omtit rese ngei. <verse eid="1CO 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21"/>Pathien'n nang a koi han suoka om mo ni ni? Asa, mindon no roh; hannirese, jôkna zora na manin chu mang roh.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:21: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">aniatachu nangman jôkna rang zorânchum no dônin chu, mang roh; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">hannirese jôkna rang zorânchum na manin chu, mang inla; manêk han suoka no om ha ne theidôr song rangin thang roh.</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22"/>Suok, Pumapa'n a koi chu Pumapa mojôk suok ania; ma angdên han suok niloi Khrista'n a koi khom hah Khrista suok ani. <verse eid="1CO 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23"/>Pathien'n mana nangni a rochôksai kêng; masikin mingei suokngei chang no roi. <verse eid="1CO 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24"/>Ka malngei, tukhom Pathien'n a koi lâia a omlam anghan Pathien leh inlopin omtit rese.<verse eid="1CO 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Inneiloingei le meithâingei chungroia chongrekelngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25"/>Atûn, inneiloi mingei chungroia nin chong miziek hah mindonin: Pumapa renga chongpêk chu ite dôn mu-unga, aniatachu, Pumapa moroina sika mi iemom ki ni sikin ki mindon lam misîr ki tih.<verse eid="1CO 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26"/>Atûnlâi intakna mindonin mi a om lam angtaka a omtit rang hih sa uol le ki minhoi. <verse eid="1CO 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27"/>Dôngma mo no dôn zoi? Amanu renga jôkna rok no roh. Inneiloi mo na la ni? Dôngma rang rok no roh. <verse eid="1CO 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28"/>Hannirese lômnu no dôn khomin nunsie tho mak chea; inneiloi nupang khomin ruothar a dôn khomin nunsie tho mak. Aniatachu in nin neiin chu rammuola dûktong nin tih, maha nangni mojôk rang ku nuom ani.<verse eid="1CO 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29"/>Ka malngei, ki ti nuom tak chu mahi ani: Zora hih abong zoia, atûn renga chu dôngma dôn ngei hah a dônloi angin om senla ngeia; <verse eid="1CO 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30"/>achap ngei hah inngûiloi angin om senla ngeia; ânnui ngei hah râisân loi angin om senla ngeia; a rochôk ngei han dônloi angin om senla ngeia; <verse eid="1CO 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31"/>hi rammuola neinun sampâr ranga sinchuon tho ngei hah anrêngin luo loi angin om rese ngei. Hi rammuol hih, atûna anghin, aom sôt khâi loi rang ani sikin.<verse eid="1CO 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32"/>Mulungdûk dôn loi rangin nangni ku nuom ani. Ruotharte'n chu Pumapa râiminsân rang a bôk sikin Pumapa sin hah a mindon ngâi. <verse eid="1CO 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33"/>Aninâkchu pasal inneisai chu a dôngma râiminsân rang a bôk sikin rammuol neinun a mindon ngâia; <verse eid="1CO 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34"/>masikin kângnikin kaiphirînin a om ngâi ani. Nupang inneiloi, aninônchu dôngmate inthieng chu a taksa le a ratha inpêkphar rang a nuom sikin Pumapa sin hah a mindon ngâia; hanchu inneisai nupangin chu a ruothar râiminsân rang a nuom sikin rammuol neinun a mindon ngâi.<verse eid="1CO 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35"/>Nangni san rang ku nuom sika mahi nangni ki tipe ani. Nin chunga balam inngar nangni khang pe rang bôk mu-ung. Manêkin, neinun adik le asa nin sin theina rang le Pumapa sinthona han ite manar tet loiin nin inpêk let theina rangin nangni ku nuom ani. <verse eid="1CO 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36"/>Dôngmate le ruotharte innei roi chu sûtminthel ani zoi, innei nôk khâi loi rang ti ngei chungroia chu: ruotharte hah dôngmate tienga han mirita omin ândînthei tet noa, innei anâng angin a rietin chu innei rese, a nuom angin,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:36: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ân bieksai abop a nuom anghan; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mi inkhat le a nâinupang inneiloi: A pa han amanu pasal rang ha amanu chunga han mirita omin ân dînthei loi angin a rietin chu, male amanu ha innei zora achukin chu, hanchu amapa han a nuomlam anghan tho senla male amanu ha in min neipui rese.</char></note> mahan nunsie om mak. <verse eid="1CO 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37"/>Aniatachu, pasal hah dânderit ani noa, ha dôngmate hah innei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:37: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">innei loi rang; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a nâinupang in min neiloi rang.</char></note> loi ranga mulungbôk det taka sinsiema, male a nuomlam a dier theipu han chu om rang chang a mulungrîla a mindon suo zoi, dôngmate<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:37: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">dôngmate hah inneipui senla; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">in min nei nirse.</char></note> hah in a neipui loi sikin a tho min sa. <verse eid="1CO 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38"/>Masikin ruotharte inneipu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:38: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">innei; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a nâinupang ha in min nei rese.</char></note> han a tho min sa, aniatachu, inneiloipu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:38: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">innei ngâi mak; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">amanu ha in min nei ngâi mak.</char></note> han a tho min sa uol.<verse eid="1CO 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39"/>Nupang inneisai hah a pasal ringsûngin chu a pasal han khit ania; hannirese, a pasal a thîn chu, pasal dang a nuom tak in a nei pui thei, Khristien ani ngânin chu. <verse eid="1CO 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40"/>Aniatachu, a om ngâiin om senla, a râisân uol atih. Maha ki mindon lam ani, male kei khom Pathien Ratha chu ko dôn angin kên bê ani.<verse eid="1CO 7:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8"/>
  <para style="s">Mirmil biekna sâknêk pêkna chungroia chongrekelna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1"/>Atûn mirimil biekna sâknêk pêkna chungroia nin chong miziek mindonin.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 8:1">“Ei rêngin rietna ei dôn,” an ti angin adik ani. Hannoma, ma anga rietna han chu mi a minpâk ngâia; aniatachu lungkhamna rêkin chu mi asin minding ngâi. <verse eid="1CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2"/>Tukhomin idôr tena mini rietna dôn sai angin ân bên chu a riet rang dôr ala riet loi ani. <verse eid="1CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3"/>Hannirese tukhomin Pathien lungkhamna a dônin chu ha mi hah Pathien'n a riet ani.<verse eid="1CO 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4"/>Masikin, mirimilngei biekna sâknêk pêka omsai sâk chungroia chu: rammuola mirimilngei murdi hih atataka inzir niloi, rimila inding an ni tie le Pathien inkhat vai aom ti chu ei riet. <verse eid="1CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5"/>Invâna mo, pilchunga mo pathien riming pêl “pathienngei” le “pumapangei” tamtak om khom senla, <verse eid="1CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6"/>eini rangin chu Pathien inkhat vai, Pa, neinuntin Sinpu hah a oma, ama ta rangin ei ringa; male Pumapa khom inkhat vai, Jisua Khrista a oma, Ama sikin neinuntin sin ania, eini khom ama sikin ei ring ani.<verse eid="1CO 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7"/>Aniatachu ma chongtak hih mi murdi'n riet mak ngeia, mi senkhat chu atûnten hin mirimilngei biek ngâiinzong an ni sikin atûnten hin mirimil ta angtaka bên an sâk jêta an sielesarietna hah ânzala, ha sâk sika han a minnim ngei angin an inbe ngâi. <verse eid="1CO 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8"/>I-ih khomnirse sâk hin Pathien leh ên zomna chu mi min sa pe thei no ni; sâk no khom ila ite dok no ih, sâk khom ila ite man uol no ih.<verse eid="1CO 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9"/>Nikhomrese, nin zalenna sintho han taksônna tienga râtloi ngei hah sietna an chul loina rangin indîn roi. <verse eid="1CO 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10"/>Chongkhatin, nangma “Rietna dôn,” ân tipu han, sielesarietna tienga râtloi mi han mirimil biekna ina na sâk lâitak nang mu senla, a sielesarietna han mirimilngei biekna sâknêk pêka omsai hah a sâk ngam rang nimak mo? <verse eid="1CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11"/>Masikin ma miriem râtloi, na lâibung Khrista'n a ruthûla a thi pepu hah nangma “Rietna” sikin ânmang rang ani! <verse eid="1CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12"/>Ma anghan nin Khristien lâibungngei le sarnungei chunga thominchâiin an sielesarietna hah mophoppên Khrista chunga nin thominchâi nîng atih. <verse eid="1CO 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13"/>Masikin sâkin ka lâibungpa mo, ka sarnu mo sietna han amathâkin chu me sâk tet khâi no ning, ka lâibungpa mo, ka sarnu mo sietna a tâk khâi loina rangin.<verse eid="1CO 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9"/>
  <para style="s">Tîrton rachamneina le sintumngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1"/>Zalên mi ni mu-ung mo? Tîrton ni mu-ung mo? Ei Pumapa Jisua mu loi mo ki ni? Male nangni khom Pumapa ta ranga ki sinthona mara nimak choi mo? <verse eid="1CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2"/>Midangngeiin tîrtonin mi pom no khom rese ngeia, nangnin chu mi nin pom ngêt! Pumapa leh nin ringna ânzom zoi sikin ki tîrton indangna chu nangni hah nin ni.<verse eid="1CO 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3"/>Mîn min makhalin chu hi anghin kên rung ngâi: <verse eid="1CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4"/>Sin ko tho theina ranga sâknêk man rangin racham ko dôn loi mo? <verse eid="1CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5"/>Tîrton dangngei le Pumapa lâibungngei le Peter ngei anghan ku khuolchaina Khristien dôngma tuong rangin racham ko dôn loi mo? <verse eid="1CO 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6"/>Aninônchu, Barnabas le keima vai mo kin ringna ranga sinthoa invâi rang? <verse eid="1CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7"/>Tu râlmingei mo anninanâk thâma invâiin râl an doi ngâi? Tu chuonsinpungei mo grapebil thoa amara sâk ngâiloi? Tu belrihôlpungei mo belri pâl vâia an runutui nêk ngâiloi?<verse eid="1CO 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8"/>Balam khomin ma angdên han ati sikin anîngtina enminkhina hih aten dôn mu-ung ani. <verse eid="1CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9"/>Moses balam lekhabua han, “Sechal hah bu ni minchîl lâitak han a mûr khit pe no roh,” ti ei pore. Atûn, Pathien'n sechal mo a mindon?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Bal 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Tim 5:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10"/>Eini ranga a misîr nimak mo? Ani, eini rang piela a miziek, âlkaipu le bu âtpu han an chang rangtum ngâituiin sin an tho rang ani. <verse eid="1CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11"/>Nin lâia ratha sachi kin rethea, nin kôm renga taksa neinun ngei ât unglang kamâmom rai no ni mo?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:27">Rom 15:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12"/>Midangngei luo mana hi taksa neinun ngei hih nin kôm renga chang rangin racham an neiin chu, keini vâng chu rachamneina lien uol kin dôn nimak mo?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Hannirese, ha rachamneina hah mang mak me. Khrista Thurchi Sa kin chakal loina rangin jâttin kin tuong zajâm ngâi.<verse eid="1CO 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13"/>Pathien Biekina sintho mingei han Biekin renga an sâk rang an man ngâi ti le mâichâma inbôlnangei min tungpungei khomin mâichâma neinunpêkngei han rangtum an dôn ngâi tiin nin riet minthâr ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:1">Bal 18:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14"/>Ma angdên han Pumapa'n Thurchisa hah a misîrpungeiin hima renga hah an sâk rangin chong a pêk ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mat 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Luk 10:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15"/>Aniatachu, Keiman chu mangei hah inkhat luo ka mang loi ani, atûn hin khom ku chunga ma anghan nin thona ranga ki miziek ni tet mak. Tutu khom kên songna hih asênaboi chongngei an minchang nêkin chu thi ving inlang kei rangin asa uol! <verse eid="1CO 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16"/>Thurchisa ki misîr sika ririemin insong theina dôn mu-ung. Thurchisa hih misîr ngêt ranga dânde kêng ki ni. Thurchisa hih misîr nôn lang chu kei rangin ichi omtak ani rang! <verse eid="1CO 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17"/>Hi sin hih keima nuom thangna sika ki sin nisenla chu thalo khôk thei ki tih; hannirese, Pathien'n hi sin hih mi minkol sikin ki sintum piela bên, ki sin ani. <verse eid="1CO 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18"/>Hanchu, kho anga thalo mo ka man rang ani zoi? Thurchi Sa rang sika ki sinthona hin ka rachamneinangei mang loia thalo boia ki sin hih thurchisa rangin zora sa ani.<verse eid="1CO 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19"/>Zalen mi ki ni, tute suok chu ni mu-ung; aniatachu thei dôra mi tamtak ngei ka lâklût theina rangin mi murdi suok ka chang ani. <verse eid="1CO 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20"/>Judangei ka lâklût theina rangin Judangei lâia chu Juda angin ko om ngâi; male Moses Balam nuoia om no khom inlang, balam nuoia om ngei kôm chu ka lâklût ngei theina rangin balam nuoia om anghan ko om ngâi. <verse eid="1CO 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21"/>Ma angdên han, Jentailngei ka lâklût theina rangin Jentailngei lâia chu Jentail angin Juda balam pêntieng ko om ngâi. Ma hah Pathien balam jôm mu-ung ki tina nimaka; Khrista balam nuoia ko om tatak ani. <verse eid="1CO 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22"/>Taksônna tom ngei ka lâklût theina rangin râtloingei lâia chu râtloi angin ko om ngâi. Masikin kho angin mo senkhat ngei luo ka sanminring theina rangin mi murdi kôm jâttin ki ni zoi.<verse eid="1CO 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23"/>Satvurna ka chang theina rangin mangei nâm hah Thurchisa sikin ki sin ani. <verse eid="1CO 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24"/>Tân insiet ngei hah anrêngin an tânna, hannirese inkhat vaiin kêng râisânman a man ngâi ti nin riet loi mo? Râisânman hah nin man theina rangin ma angtak han tân roi. <verse eid="1CO 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25"/>Insietna akop ngeiin chu lam tina an indîn ngâi. Anni chu rênglukhum sietthei man rangin an insieta eini chu rênglukhum siet theiloi kumtuonga om rang man rang ei ni. <verse eid="1CO 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26"/>Masikin ânjîkzatin zoina tenkung tieng ka tân ngâia; masikin kuttum leh insuk ngâipu'n min pâm loia a kuttum leh a suk ngâi angin ki ni. <verse eid="1CO 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27"/>Midangngei insietna taka ko koitûp suole keima chukloia ko om loina rangin, ka takpum dûk min tongin ke sep ngâi ani.<verse eid="1CO 9:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10"/>
  <para style="s">Mirmilngei doia inningnangei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1"/>Ka lâibungngei le sarnungei, ei richibulngei Moses jûingei chunga neinun atung hah nin riet bang rangin ku nuom ani. Anrêngin sûm thupna nuoia an om rieia hoiriemin Tuipui Sen varâl an kâi ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:21-22">Jôk 13:21-22</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:22-29">Jôk 14:22-29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2"/>Sûm le tuipuia han Moses nûkjûingei nitheina rangin anrêngin baptis changin an om ani. <verse eid="1CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3"/>Anrêngin rathatienga bu munkhatin an nêka,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:35">Jôk 16:35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4"/>munkhatin rathatienga tui an nêka. Anni ngei leh sepuipu rathatienga lungpui renga tui an nêka; ma lungpui hah Khrista ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:6">Jôk 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:11">Tel 20:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5"/>Aniatachu an lâia mi tam uol chunga chu Pathien mulunghoi maka, ramchâra han an ruok ânzamnung ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:29">Tel 14:29</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 14:30">30</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6"/>Atûn, ma ngei hah eini ranga minenna ani, neinun saloi ngei an ngâitui angin ei ngâitui loina rang le<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:4">Tel 11:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7"/>an lâia mi senkhat mirimilngei an biek angin ei biek loina rangin. Pathien lekhabu'n, “Mingei ha ruolhoia sâk rangin an insunga, hannirese junêk le indit hoiinhâinân an inlet nôk” ati angin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:6">Jôk 32:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8"/>An lâia mi senkhatin inditnasaloi an songa, sûnkhat sûngin mi isâng sômnikleithum an thi anghan eini chu inditna saloi song no uh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-18">Tel 25:1-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9"/>An lâia mi senkhat Pumapa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:9: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pumapa; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngei an chu dôn </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khrista.</char></note> an minsina, murûlin amuchuk that ngei ok anghan minsin no uh. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:5">Jôk 21:5</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 21:6">6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10"/>An lâia mi senkhat Pathien kôm an chiera, Thina Vântîrtonin a minmang ngei anghan chier no uh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:41-49">Tel 16:41-49</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11"/>Ma an chunga neinun tung ngei murdi hah midangngei rangin minennangei ania, eini zora monga lêng ngei inningna ranga mangei ha miziek ani. <verse eid="1CO 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12"/>Adettaka inding nin ni tiin nin mindonin chu nin inlet loina rangin indîn roi. <verse eid="1CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13"/>Huongna nin tong ngei murdi hah mingei tuong ngâi tena ani. Pathien chu a chonginkhâma iem aom sikin nin phari loi rang dôr chu huongna nin tong rang phal no nih; huongna nin tuong zorân tuongdierna ranak nangni pêk a ta, male huongna jôkna lampui khom nangni sin pe atih.<verse eid="1CO 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14"/>Masikin, ku ruol moroitak ngei, mirimilngei biek hih mâk ta roi. <verse eid="1CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15"/>Arietvar mingei kôma misîr anghan nin kôm ki misîr ani; ku thurchi misîr hih mindon roi. <verse eid="1CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16"/>Satvurna khuri chunga Pathien kôm râisânchong ei misîr ngâi: ei nêkin Khrista thisen hah ên sempuina ani. Male vâipôl ei khoi ngâi ha: ei sâk khom hih Khrista takpum ên sempuina ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:26-28">Mat 26:26-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-24">Mk 14:22-24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:19-20">Luk 22:19-20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17"/>Vâipôl hih tâpkhat ani angin, eini hih mi tamtak ni khom ila, vâipôl tâpkhat renga ei rêngin ei chang pak sikin takpum inkhat ei ni.<verse eid="1CO 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18"/>Israel mingei hah en ta u, inbôlna neinunpêka om sâk ngei han mâichâma Pathien sin hah an insempui ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:6">Och 7:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19"/>Mirimil aninônchu a kôma sâk pêka om hah neinun kâmom ki tina mo? <verse eid="1CO 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20"/>Nimak! ki ti chu sonongngei mâichâmngeia inbôlna hah Pathien kôm niloiin ramkhoringei kôm kêng an pêk ani. Ramkhoringei leh lôminchang rangin chu nangni phal tet mu-ung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:17">Bal 32:17</ref> (LXX)</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21"/>Pumapa khuri le ramkhoringei khuri nêk molop thei no tunui; Pumapa dosâng le ramkhoringei dosâng khom sâk molop thei no tunui. <verse eid="1CO 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22"/>Aninônchu Pumapa hah ei min nuor rang mo? Ama nêka rât uolin ên be mini?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Bal 32:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23"/>“Jâttin tho thei rangin phal ei ni,” an ti anghan. Adik, hannirese jâttin nâm sa let mak. “Jâttin tho thei rangin phal ei ni,” aniatachu jâttin hi satna ni let mak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:12">1 Kor 6:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24"/>Tutu khom athei vaia satna rang vai rok loiin midang satna rang rok rese.<verse eid="1CO 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25"/>Me bazara an zuor kai chu ite rekel loiin nin sielesarietna sikin sâk roi. <verse eid="1CO 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26"/>Pathien lekhabu'n, “Pilchung le asûnga omngei murdi hih Pumapa ta ani,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:1">Lap 24:1</ref></char></note> ati sikin.<verse eid="1CO 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27"/>Sonong inkhatin bunêk rang nangni a sielin se ta ungla, nangni a do kai chu rekel tet loiin nin sielesarietna sikin sâk roi. <verse eid="1CO 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28"/>Aniatachu tumakatin, “Hi sâk hih mirimil kôma pêksai ani,” tiin nangni a rilin chu nangni rilpu sik le ama sielesarietna sikin sâk no roi <verse eid="1CO 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29"/>ma hih nin sielesarietna ki ti nimaka, midangngei sielesarietna ki ti kêng.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:29">“Asa, hanchu,” senkhatin, “Iranga midang sielesarietna han ka zalena tentana mi sin pe mini? tiin an rekel ngâi ani. <verse eid="1CO 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30"/>Ka sâk chunga Pathien kôm râisânchong ki misîr sai piel ha irang mo mîn min la êro ngâi hi?”<verse eid="1CO 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31"/>Asa, ma anghan nin sin murdi, nin sâk le nin nêk murdi, Pathien roiinpuina rangin tho roi. <verse eid="1CO 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32"/>Judangei, Jentailngei le Pathien koiindangngei ta ranga bâiinkhamna nin niloina rang lam takin om roi. <verse eid="1CO 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33"/>Ko tho angtak hin tho roi; Keima rang satna rok loiin, sanminring an ni theina ranga mi murdi satna rang rokin, ki sinthona nâma mi murdi râiminsân rangin ki mindon ngâi ani.<verse eid="1CO 10:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1"/>Khrista nunchan inchupu ki ni anghan, ku nunchan inchu ngei ni roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:16">1 Kor 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:17">Phili 3:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Inkhômna taka lukhum inkhum chungroi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2"/>Mi nin riettit ngâi sik le nangni ki minchunangei nin jûi tit ngâi sikin nangni ki minpâk. <verse eid="1CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3"/>Aniatachu, pasal lu chu Khrista ani, nupang lu chu pasal ani, male Khrista lu chu Pathien ani ti nin riet rangin ku nuom. <verse eid="1CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4"/>Masikin pasal lukhum inkhum puma inkhômna taka chubaitho ngâi mini, thurchi misîr ngâi ngei mini chu Khrista an lu hah mâimôk an shak ani. <verse eid="1CO 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5"/>Male nupang tukhom lukhum inkhum loia inkhômna taka chubaitho ngâi mini, thurchi misîr ngâi ngei mini khom an lu, an pasal mâimôk an shak ania; ma anga nupang chu nupang an sam zietminkol leh ateina om mak ani. <verse eid="1CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6"/>Nupangin lukhum ân khum nuom nônchu epin ep let rese, ma anga nupang rangin samep mo, luvoi mo hi inzakpui aomin chu lukhum tho rese. <verse eid="1CO 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7"/>Pasal chu Pathien rimil in-angpui le Pathien roiinpuina minlang ngâipu ani sikin lukhum ân khum rang nâng mak. Aniatachu nupang chu pasal roiinpuina minlang ngâinu ania;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26-27">Aph 1:26-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8"/>pasal hih nupang renga sin nimaka, aninâka nupang chu pasal renga sin ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8,9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:18-23">Aph 2:18-23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9"/>Pasal hih nupang jâra sin khom nimaka, aninâka nupang rêk chu pasal jâra sin ani. <verse eid="1CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10"/>Masikin vântîrtonngei sika han nupangin pasal rachamneina nuoia om ani ti indangna rangin lukhum a tho rang ani. <verse eid="1CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11"/>Nikhomrese, Pumapa taka ei ringnuna hin nupang hih pasal boiin chu om thei maka, pasal khom nupang boiin chu om thei mak. <verse eid="1CO 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12"/>Nupang hih pasal renga sin ani anghan pasal hih nupang renga suok ania; male jâttin hih Pathien renga ânzir let ani.<verse eid="1CO 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13"/>Mindon ta u, nupang lukhum inkhum loia inkhômna taka Pathien kôm chubaitho ânhoi mo? <verse eid="1CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14"/>Pasal sam minsei chu ata rangin neinun inzakom ani ti nin inzirpui mulungrîl khomin a riet nimak mo? <verse eid="1CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15"/>Nupang sam minsei chu ama roiinpuina ania, a sam hah ama inkhum rang piela pêk ani. <verse eid="1CO 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16"/>Aniatachu, tumakhatin hi roi hih a makhal an om lekhom, mapêna hi chu balam dang reng dôn mak me, Pathien koiindangngei khomin dôn mak ngei.<verse eid="1CO 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pumapa jânbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Mat 26:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Mk 14:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22:14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17"/>Nikhomrese, nangni ki rilnangei zomin chu nangni minpâk mu-ung, nin satna rang niloiin nin siet uolna rangin nin inkhôm ngâi sikin. <verse eid="1CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18"/>Amotontaka, nin intûpnangei han doi pâlngei an om ti mîn min rila; male ma hih dik lekhom ki iem ani. <verse eid="1CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19"/>(Midik ngei hah an inlang theina rangin nin lâia insenna aom rang piel ani.) <verse eid="1CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20"/>Apâla nin intûp zora nin sâk ngâi hah Pumapa Jânbu nimak. <verse eid="1CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21"/>Nin nêkin nin bu pak motona nin nêk baka, senkhat nin inrûi lâiin senkhat nin von achâm ngâi sikin. <verse eid="1CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22"/>Nin sâk nin nêkna rangin inngei nin dônloi mo? Aninônchu, Pathien koiindang en min nuoiin mi intak ngei hah mâimôk nin shak mini? Hi chungroia hin imo ti-le mi nin minhoi? Nangni ki minpâk rang mini? Nangni minpâk tet mu-ung.<verse eid="1CO 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23"/>Inchuna nangni ke pêk ngei hah Pumapa kôm renga ka man kêng: Pumapa Jisua minsûra aom ni jâna han vâipôl hâr a lâka. <verse eid="1CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24"/>Pathien kôm râisânchong a misîr suole a khoia, “Hi ma hih ka taksa nin ruthûla pêk rang hah ani. Mi nin riettitna rangin ma hih tho ngâi roi,” a tia. <verse eid="1CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25"/>Ma angdên han, jânbu an nêk suole khuri khom a lâka, “Hi khuri hih Pathien chonginkhitna athar ki thisena mindet ani. Nin buong racham mi nin riettitna rangin tho ngâi roi,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:6-8">Jôk 24:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31:31-34</ref></char></note> a tia.<verse eid="1CO 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26"/>Zoratin hi vâipôl hih nin sâka, khuri renga nin buong racham a juong nôk mâka chu Pumapa thina hah nin phuong ani. <verse eid="1CO 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27"/>Masikin tukhom chukloi pumin Pumapa vâipôl hih nin sâka, a khuri renga buong ngei kai chu Pumapa taksa le thisen chunga theiloi chang nin tih, tiin ajûi sa ngâi ani. <verse eid="1CO 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28"/>Masikin mitin inphuol bak ungla, masuole vâipôl hah sâkin male khuri renga hah buong roi. <verse eid="1CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29"/>Vâipôl sâkpu le khuri renga buongpu ngei han Pumapa taksa omtie nin riet minthâr nônchu nin sâk le nin buong sika han nin chunga roijêkna nin mintung ani. <verse eid="1CO 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30"/>Masika han kêng nin inzala, damloiin nin oma male mi tamtak nin thi. <verse eid="1CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31"/>Eini nanâkin inphuol bak ila chu Pathien roijêkna nuoia om no uh. <verse eid="1CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32"/>Aniatachu rammuol leh munkhata theiloi ei chang loina rangin Pumapa jêkin le dûkmintongin ei om ngâi.<verse eid="1CO 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33"/>Masikin, ka lâibungngei le sarnungei, Pumapa jânbu ot ranga nin intûpin inngâk inlôm ngâi roi. <verse eid="1CO 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34"/>Nin intûpin Pathien roijêkna nuoia nin omloina rangin tutu khom a vonchâmin chu a ina nêk rese. Roi dangngei nâm chu ko hong tika hong min sûk ki tih.<verse eid="1CO 11:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12"/>
  <para style="s">Ratha Inthieng renga manboipêkngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1"/>Atûn, Ratha Inthieng tienga manboipêkngei chungroia nin miziek ngei mindonin.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:1">Ka lâibungngei le sarnungei hima roia han adiktakin nin riet rangin nangni ku nuom. <verse eid="1CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2"/>Sonong nin ni lâihan chu ringna dônloi mirimilngei biekna lamtieng tuong minvâiin nin om ngâi ti nin riet. <verse eid="1CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3"/>Tutên Pathien Ratha ruoiin, “Jisua chu vânisal ani!” ti thei ngâi mak ngei ti le tutên Ratha Inthieng ruoi loiin, “Jisua chu Pumapa ani,” ti thei mak ngei ti hih nin riet rangin ku nuom.<verse eid="1CO 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4"/>Rathatienga neinunpêkngei adadang an oma, aniatachu ha Ratha nanâk han a pêk ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4-11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:6-8">Rom 12:6-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5"/>Sinthona lam adadang ngei aoma, aniatachu Pumapa sin nanâk ani. <verse eid="1CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6"/>Sinthona rangin thotheinangei adadang an oma, aniatachu Pathien nanâkin mitin kôm sin an thona rangin thotheina a pêk ngei ngâi ani. <verse eid="1CO 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7"/>Mitin satna rangin Ratha aom ti ei misang chita lam tamtakin ânlang. <verse eid="1CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8"/>Ratha han mi senkhat kôm vârna sip chong misîr theina a pêka, midang kôm han ma Ratha dên han rietna sip chong a pêk ngâi. <verse eid="1CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9"/>Ma Ratha inkhat nanâk han mi inkhat kôm taksônna a pêka, midang kôm han mindam theina a pêk. <verse eid="1CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10"/>Ratha han mi inkhat kôm sin kamâmom thotheina a pêka; adang kôm, Pathien chongbê misîr theina a pêka; male midang inkhat kôm Ratha adik le dikloi riet sensâi theina a pêka. Midang inkhat kôm rietloi chonga thurchi misîr theina a pêka, male midang kôm rietloi chong rilminthâr theina a pêk ani. <verse eid="1CO 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11"/>Aniatachu ha ngei murdi thopu hah Ratha inkhat dên ania; a nuom lam angtakin, mitin kôm manboipêk adadang a pêk ngâi ani.<verse eid="1CO 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Takpum inkhata abâkngei tamtak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12"/>Khrista hih takpum inkhat angin ania, abâkngei tamtak a dôna, abâkngei tamtaka sin nikhomsenla maha takpum inkhat dên ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:4-5">Rom 12:4-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13"/>Ma angdên han, ei rêngin Judangei mo, Jentailngei mo, suokngei mo, suokngei niloi mo takpum inkhata om rangin Ratha inkhat dên han baptis ei nia, male ei rêngin Ratha inkhatin buong rangin pêkin ei om zoi ani.<verse eid="1CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14"/>Takpum hih abâk inkhat vai niloiin, abâkngei tamtak ani. <verse eid="1CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15"/>Kepha hin, “Kut ki niloi sikin takpuma kop mu-ung,” ti ta senla masika han takpuma koploi ni uol no nih. <verse eid="1CO 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16"/>Kuor hin, “Mit ki niloi sikin takpuma kop ni mu-ung,” ti ta senla masika han takpuma koploi ni uol no nih. <verse eid="1CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17"/>Takpumpui hih mit nizit ta senla kho angin mo a rangâi thei rang? Kuor nizit ta senla inmo amirim a riet rang? <verse eid="1CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18"/>Ma anghan, nikhomrese, Pathien'n takpuma hin a nuomnana muna a abâk a mokhop ani. <verse eid="1CO 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19"/>Anrêngin abâk khat ni ta senla, takpum khom om no ni! <verse eid="1CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20"/>Ma anghan abâkngei tamtak nikhom senla takpum chu inkhat kêng ani.<verse eid="1CO 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21"/>Masika han mitngei hin kutngei kôm, “Nangni nâng mak me!” ti thei mak ngei. Lu khomin kephangei kôm “Nangni min nâng mu-ung!” ti thei uol mak. <verse eid="1CO 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22"/>Ani, hima nêkin, takpum abâk râtloi anga ânlang ngei hih kam an nâng uol tatak ania; <verse eid="1CO 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23"/>male takpuma ei minlut ok ngâiloi abâkngei hih ei minlut tak ani ngâia; ei takpum abâk enhoi bâkloi ngei hin enhoina lien uol an man ngâi, <verse eid="1CO 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24"/>ei takpum abâk enhoi uol ngeiin chu ma anga tho rang hah nâng mak. Pathien lelên enhoina dônloi abâkngei hah minlut uolin takpum hih aminpholom ani. <verse eid="1CO 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25"/>Masikin takpuma hin insenna om maka; abâkngei murdi hin inangsarrin an mindon inlôm ngâi ani. <verse eid="1CO 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26"/>Ma anghan abâk inkhatin atuongin chu abâk dangngei khom an tuongpui sa ngâi; abâk inkhatin minpâkin aomin chu abâk dangngei murdi'n an râiasân pui ngâi.<verse eid="1CO 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27"/>Nin rêngin Khrista takpum nin nia, male nin sika abâk inkhat chit nin ni. <verse eid="1CO 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28"/>Koiindanga Pathien'n hi mingei hih an mun chita a dar ngeia: inkhatna tîrtonngei, inikna dêipungei, inthumna minchupungei; masuole chu sininkhêl sinpungei, mindam theina ranak dônpungei, mi san theina ranak dônpungei, roijêk theina ranak dônpungei le rietloi chonga thurchi misîr theina manboipêk changpungei hah an ni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:11">Eph 4:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29"/>Anrêngin tîrtonngei mini, dêipungei mini, minchupungei mini ni let mak ngei. Mitinin sininkhêlngei sin thei let mak ngei <verse eid="1CO 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30"/>ri-ngei mindam theina mini, rietloi chonga thurchi misîr theina mini, rilminthâr theina mini dôn let mak ngei. <verse eid="1CO 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31"/>Hanchu, manboipêk kâmom uol ngei chunga han nin mulungngei hah dar roi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Nikhomrese, mangei kâra asatak, chu a nuoia hih ani.<verse eid="1CO 12:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13"/>
  <para style="s">Lungkhamna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1"/>Miriem chongngei le vântîrtonngei chongin thurchi misîr thei khom ronga lungkhamna ko dôn nônchu, ko chongngei hih jâmluong miring aninônchu sûmeng tôk miring angin kêng ani rang. <verse eid="1CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2"/>Thurchi misîr theina neinunpêk dôn khom ronga; chong inthupngei murdi rietheina le rietnangei nâm dôn khom ronga; muolngei thînpai theina taksônna dôn khom ronga aniatachu lungkhamna ko dôn nônchu, ite ni mu-ung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:21">21:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:23">Mk 11:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3"/>Inriengngei rangin ko dôn murdi pêk khom inlang, male ka takpum tena khom kâng<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:3; </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kâng rangin; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngei an dôn chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">insongpui theina rangin.</char></note> let rangin ka takpumpui pêk khom inlang, lungkhamna ko dôn nônchu ite a satna om mak.<verse eid="1CO 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4"/>Lungkhamna chu atuongdiera male moroina adôna; narsa ngâi maka, inpâk ngâi maka, omin-ân tho ngâi maka; <verse eid="1CO 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5"/>Lungkhamnân chu omsaloingei tho ngâi maka, ama satna rang rok ngâi mak, a ningthik ngâi mak; dikloinangei mindon tit ngâi mak; <verse eid="1CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6"/>Lungkhamnân chu saloina arâisân ngâi mak, aniatachu, chongdika kêng arâisân ngâi. <verse eid="1CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7"/>Lungkhamnân chu atuong zajâma; a taksônna ngei, a sabeina ngei le atuongtheina ngeia duoi ngâi mak.<verse eid="1CO 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8"/>Lungkhamna hih kumtuonga om ani. Thurchi misîrnangei hih om khom senla la min mong nîng atih; rietloi chongngeia manboipêkngei hih om khom senla, la mong an tih; rietna hih om khom senla lan mang atih. <verse eid="1CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9"/>Akiploiin ei rieta akiploiin thurchingei ei misîr ngâia; <verse eid="1CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10"/>hannirese akipphar hih ajuong tika chu akiploi hih inmang atih zoi.<verse eid="1CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11"/>Nâipang ki ni lâihan chu, ko chongngei, ko khorietnangei le ki mindonnangei khom nâi ânpanga; aniatachu atûn chu ulien ki ni zoi sikin nâipang tho ngâi hah chu ka mâk zoi ani. <verse eid="1CO 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12"/>Atûna ei mu hih chu lîmena rimil ânlangdap angin ania; nangkana chu mâi-intongin la mûng ei tih. Atûna ki riet hih chu akiploi ania; nangkana chu kip atih zoi, Pathien'n keima ni rietna akipphar anghan.<verse eid="1CO 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13"/>Mangei inthum: taksôna, sabeina, le lungkhamna ngei hi chu omtit atih; male mangei lâia aroiinpuitak chu lungkhamna hih ani.<verse eid="1CO 13:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14"/>
  <para style="s">Ratha manboipêk tamtakngei roi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1"/>Hanchu, nin rujûl rang tak chu lungkhamna hih ani. Rathatienga neinunpêkngei chunga han nin mulungngei ha dar roi, aliekin Pathien thurchi misîr theina neinunpêk hah rujûl roi. <verse eid="1CO 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2"/>Rietloi chonga chongpu ngei hah miriemngei kôm an chong nimaka Pathien kôm an chong ani, asikchu an chong hah tutên riet mak ngei. Anni ngei han Ratha sinthotheinân chongtak inthupngei ha an misîr ani. <verse eid="1CO 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3"/>Aniatachu Pathien thurchi misîrpu ngei han miriemngei kôm an misîr ania male sanna ngei, mohôkna ngei le phûkdâina ngei apêk ngâi. <verse eid="1CO 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4"/>Rietloi chonga chongpu ngei han chu anninanâk vai mâsôn an ta, aniatachu Pathien thurchi misîrpu ngei han chu koiindang pumpui an sinsiem ngâi.<verse eid="1CO 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5"/>Nin rêngin rietloi chongngeiin thurchi nin misîr rangin nangni ku nuom; hannirese Pathien chong phuong theina neinunpêk dôn rangin nangni ku nuom uol. Rietloi chong chu koiindang pumpuiin sinminsana an manna ranga rilminthâr thei an om no vângin chu Pathien thurchi misîrpu hah rietloi chonga thurchi misîrpu nêkin chu a lut uol ok ani. <verse eid="1CO 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6"/>Masikin atûn sûngsuokngei, keiman nin kôm juongin rietloi chong juong tho ronga, chongphuong mo, rietna mo, ratha chongphuong mo, minchuna chong mo, ku juong chôi nônchu nin ta rangin imo asena aom rang?<verse eid="1CO 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7"/>Ringnadônloi miringhoi mangruongei theili mo, serânda mo an mût le an ât hah amiring ânthâr nônchu ilâ mo an minjûi khom ânthâr nônchu kho angin mo riet thei ani rang? <verse eid="1CO 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8"/>Bekul khom hih a mûtpu'n a mût minthâr nônchu tumo râl kâp rangin ânthok rang? <verse eid="1CO 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9"/>Ma angdên han, nangni khom chong rietbai lamin nin misîr nônchu, i roi mo nin misîr inmo riet thei ani ranga? Nin chongngei hah môk chochong ani rang! <verse eid="1CO 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10"/>Rammuola hin chong jât tamtak aoma, hannoma inkhat luo asena boi reng om mak ngei. <verse eid="1CO 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11"/>Aniatachu achong omtie ki riet nônchu kei rangin chu ma chong mangpu ngei hah ramdangmingei nîng a ta, kei khom anni rangin ramdangmi nîng ki tih. <verse eid="1CO 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12"/>Ratha neinunpêkngei dôn rang nin ngâitui anghan jâttin nêka asatak koiindang sinmindingna ranga mang uol rang ngei ha man rangin pût ngêt roi.<verse eid="1CO 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13"/>Hanchu rietloi chonga chong ngâipu han a rilminthâr sa theina rangin chubaitho ngêt rese. <verse eid="1CO 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14"/>Masikin rietloi chonga ku chubaitho chu ka ratha'n chu a chubai ngâia, hannirese ki mindonna chu mahan kopna dôn mak. <verse eid="1CO 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15"/>Hanchu itak mo ko tho rang ani zoi? Ratha'n chubaitho ka ta, ki mindonna khomin chubaitho sa ki tih; Ka ratha'n lâtho ka ta, ka mindonnân khom lâtho sâng ka tih. <verse eid="1CO 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16"/>Pathien kôm, Ratha vaiin râisânchong ni rilin chu, mi papai ânsungngei han no chong omtie hah riet noni ngeia, inmo na râisânchongril hah “Amen” an ti thei rang? <verse eid="1CO 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17"/>Pathien kôma na râisânchongril chubaithona han asân asa khom ni ti thei, nikhomsenla midangngei sanna chu nimak.<verse eid="1CO 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18"/>Nangni nêkin rietloi chong ka mang uol sikin Pathien chunga asân ka râiasân. <verse eid="1CO 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19"/>Hannirese koiindang inkhôma chu rietloi chongbâingei isâng tamtak misîr nêkin mingei an rietthei rang lamin minchuna chongbâingei rangnga misîr ki tih.<verse eid="1CO 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20"/>Sûngsuokngei, nin mindonna tieng chu nâi inpang no ungla; sietna tieng chu nâi inpang roi, nin mindonna tieng chu ulien ni roi.<verse eid="1CO 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21"/>Pathien lekhabungeia ma hih miziek ani:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:11-12">Isa 28:11-12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">“Pumapa'n, chong dangin ramdangmingei mûrrin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">ki mingei kôm thurchi misîr ki tih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">Ramdangmingei bâiin chong ka ta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">hannirese ki mingeiin ni rangâi pe uol noni ngei,” a ti, ti hih.<verse eid="1CO 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22"/>Masikin rietloi chong thona neinunpêk hih iemloipungei rangin sînthona ania, iempungei rang nimak, hanchu Pathien thurchi chongphuongna neinunpêk chu iempungei rangin sînthona ania, iemloipungei rang nimak.<verse eid="1CO 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23"/>Hanchu, koiindang pumpui inkhômna han nin rêngin rietloi chongin chong ta ungla, male amolmangei senkhat aninônchu iemloipungei hong lût ta senla ngei, nin rêngin nin chângluk zoi nangni ti noni ngei mo? <verse eid="1CO 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24"/>Aniatachu nin rêngin Pathien thurchi misîr ta ungla, iemloipungei aninônchu mi amolmangei, ahong lût ngei hah nin chong an rieta han an siet tie min riet atih. An chong rangâi han anni ngei ha jêk a ta, <verse eid="1CO 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25"/>an mindonna inthupngei hah minlangin om atih, an sietnangei inphuong an ta, inbokin Pathien chubaimûk an ta, “Nin lâia Pathien aom tatak!” an ti rang.<verse eid="1CO 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Koiindang sûnga chongpêk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26"/>Ka lâibungngei le sarnungei, ma hih ki tina abi chu ani. Nin inkhômin mi inkhatin minpâkna lâ, adangin minchuna chong, adangin Pathien renga chongphuong, male adangin rietloi chongngei le rilminthârna ngei nin dôn pak ngâi. Jâttin koiindang min sana rangin tho ngêt ni rese. <verse eid="1CO 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27"/>Tumakhatin rietloi chongin a chongin chu, inik mini, atamtakin inthum mini nisenla, inthâk senla ngeia male tumakhatin imo an ti ha rilminthâr ngêt ni rese. <verse eid="1CO 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28"/>Hannirese tute a rilminthâr thei an om nônchu koiindang inkhôma chu dâirek ngêt senla ama le Pathien kôm vai mang rese. <verse eid="1CO 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29"/>Pathien thurchi misîr ngei khom inik, inthum vaiin misîr senla ngei, midangin asadimin lei rangâi rese ngei. <verse eid="1CO 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30"/>Aniatachu ânsung ngei lâia han inkhat lamin chongphuong rang an omin chu a misîr masapu hah dâirek rese. <verse eid="1CO 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31"/>Mi nâmin an inchu theina rang le mohôka an om theina rangin inkhat inkhatin Pathien chong nin misîr thei. <verse eid="1CO 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32"/>Pathien thurchi misîr theina neinunpêk hah thurchi misîrpu jêkna nuoia aom rang ani. <verse eid="1CO 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33"/>Pathien'n injêl rangin mi nuom maka, minhoi rang le inngêi rangin mi nuom sikin.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Koiindang tina Pathien mingei anghan, <verse eid="1CO 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34"/>koiindang inkhômngeia chu nupangngei hah an dâirek rang ani. An chong rang phal nimaka; Juda balamin ati anghan chong an jôm ngêt rang ani. <verse eid="1CO 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35"/>Imakhat riet nuom an dônnin chu insûnga an pasalngei rekel rese ngei. Nupang rangin chu Pathien koiindang inkhômna taka chong rang hih inzakpui om ani.<verse eid="1CO 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36"/>Pathien chong hi nangni renga suok ani thei rang mo? Aninônchu nin kôm vai mo ajuong tung? <verse eid="1CO 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37"/>Tumakhatin Pathien thangtheipu mini, rathatienga neinunpêk dônnin mini an inbên chu nin kôma ko chong miziek hih Pumapa chongpêk ani ti lei riet ngêt rese. <verse eid="1CO 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38"/>Hannirese lunghâng a tho nônchu ama khom lunghâng tho no roi.<verse eid="1CO 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39"/>Masikin, ka lâibungngei le sarnungei, Pathien thurchi misîr hih asân lunghâng tho ungla rietloi chonga thurchi misîr ngei khom khap no roi. <verse eid="1CO 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40"/>Neinuntin hih asadimin le ani rang lam takin tho ngêt ni rese.<verse eid="1CO 14:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15"/>
  <para style="s">Khrista inthoinôkna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1"/>Male ka lâibungngei le sarnungei, Thurchi Sa nangni ke lei ril hah atûn hin nangni minrietnôk ku nuom, male ma nin pomna chunga han nin taksônna ânding mindet ngâi ani. <verse eid="1CO 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2"/>Ma hah thurchisa, nin kôma ki misîr hah ani. Nin iem papai aninoa, nin pom mindet tatakin chu ma thurchisa han nangni sanminring ani zoi.<verse eid="1CO 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3"/>Moton renga ka man kai chu nangni ki misîr pe ngâi, ma hi aroiinpui tataka: Khrista hah Pathien Lekhabungeia ânziek angin ei nunsiengei sikin a thia;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:5-12">Isa 53:5-12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4"/>Pathien Lekhabungeia ânziek anghan an phûma, sûnthum suole kaithoiin a oma; <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-10">Lap 16:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:40">Mat 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:24-32">Sin 2:24-32</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5"/>Peter kôm ânlâra masuole tîrton sômleinik ngei nâm kôm ânlâr nôk.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:34">Luk 24:34</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:16-17">Mat 28:16-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14">Mk 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:34">Luk 24:34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 24:36">36</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19">Joh 20:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6"/>Hanchu voikhat chu ama jûi ngâi ngei raza rangnga nêka tam ngei lâia ânlâr nôka, mangei lâia mi senkhat thi ta khom senla ngeia, atam uol chu an la ringa. <verse eid="1CO 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7"/>Hanchu Jacob kôm ânlâr nôka, masuole chu tîrtonngei nâm kôm ânlâr nôk.<verse eid="1CO 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8"/>Anûktaka chu keima azora niloia suok nikhom ronga ko kôm khom ânlâr nôka. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">tha kiploia suok; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">azora niloia suokpu.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:3-6">Sin 9:3-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9"/>Kei chu tîrtonngei lâia achîntak, Pathien koiindangngei dûk ko tho sika tîrton inti rang luo inhoi loi ki ni. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Sin 8:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10"/>Aniatachu Pathien moroina sikin imo ki ni chu ki ni zoi, male a moroina ni pêk ha akorong chang maka. Manêk han tîrton dangngei murdi nêkin a sin uol tak ka la ni, nikhomsenla maha keima ki sin nimaka, hannirese Pathien moroina ko kôma om han kêng a sin ani. <verse eid="1CO 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11"/>Masikin, keima renga mo, anni renga mo, ma hih kin renga kin misîr ania, male nangni khom ma hih nin iem zoi ani.<verse eid="1CO 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ei inthoinôkna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12"/>Atûn, Khrista hah thina renga ânthoinôk ti chong nangni ki misîr pe hah nin iem suole khom ithomo nin lâia mi senkhatin mithi inthoinôkna reng hih om mak nin ti? <verse eid="1CO 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13"/>Mithi inthoinôkna reng hih aom nônchu Khrista khom kaithoiin om mak tina ania; <verse eid="1CO 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14"/>male Khrista hih thina renga kaithoiin aom nônchu, ite misîr rang dôn mak mea, male nin iem rang khom ite dôn mak chei. <verse eid="1CO 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15"/>Mapêna han, Khrista hih thina renga a kaithoi kin ti sikin Pathien chungroia milak kin minlang nîng a ta, mithi ngei aringin kaithoiin om mak ngei ti hih adikin chu, Khrista khom a kaithoi loi nîng atih. <verse eid="1CO 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16"/>Mithi ngei kaithoiin an om nônchu Khrista khom kaithoiin a la omloi nîng atih. <verse eid="1CO 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17"/>Male Khrista hah kaithoiin aom noa anînchu nan taksônna hah khom kâmnângloi nîng a ta, male nin sietnangei han nin lân mang tit ani rang. <verse eid="1CO 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18"/>Mapêna iempungei Khrista jâra lei thi ngei khom hah an inmang zoi tina ani sa rang. <verse eid="1CO 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19"/>Atûnlâi damsûng rang vaia Khrista chunga sabeina dôna masuole chu dôn khâiloi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:19: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Atûnlâi damsûng vaia Khrista chunga sabeina dôna masuole chu dôn khâiloi einin chu; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ei damsûnga sabeina ei dôna hih Khrista chunga anîn chu.</char></note> einin chu rammuola mingei nâm nêka inriengomtak nîng ei tih.<verse eid="1CO 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20"/>Aniatachu chongtak chu Khrista hah thina renga kaithoiin aom ngêt ani, thina taka a in ngei hah kaithoiin la om ngêt an tih, ti khâmnân. <verse eid="1CO 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21"/>Miriem inkhat sika thina ahong om anghan miriem inkhat sika nanâkin inthoinôkna ahong om ani. <verse eid="1CO 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22"/>Mi murdi Adam leh an inzomna sika an thi anghan mi murdi Khrista leh an inzomna sikin kaithoiin om an tih. <verse eid="1CO 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23"/>Hannirese an zora angtakin kaithoi nîng an tih; amotontaka Khrista ania, Khrista ta ngei chu a juong nôk tika kaithoiin om an tih. <verse eid="1CO 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24"/>Hanchu zora mongna tung a ta; rathatienga roijêkpungei, rachamneipungei le sinthotheinangei hah Khrista'n zoilet a ta, male Rêngram hah Pa Pathien kuta bâng atih zoi. <verse eid="1CO 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25"/>Pathien'n a râlngei a mene rieia a ke nuoia a dar mâka chu Khrista ânlal tit rang ani. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Lap 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26"/>Râl nûktaka zoia om rang chu thina hih ani. <verse eid="1CO 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27"/>Pathien Lekhabu'n atia, “Pathien'n neinunngei <char style="it">murdi </char> a ke nuoia a darleta,” masikin “neinunngei murdi” ti chong hin Pathien neinunngei murdi Khrista ke nuoia darpu chu huom mak tiin ânlang ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Lap 8:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28"/>Hannirese neinunngei murdi Khrista roijêkna nuoia a dar tika chu, Nâipasal khom Pathien neinunngei murdi a nuoia a darpu nuoia om a ta; male Pathien chu neinuntin chunga roijêk atih zoi.<verse eid="1CO 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29"/>Atûn, mi senkhatngei an ti anghan, mithi ngei aringin inthoinôk mak ngei, an ti hih adikin chu, athipu sika baptis chang ngei chungroi ha imo ani rang? Imo sintho lenna ha an sabei rang? Irang mo mingei han athipu sika baptis an chang ranga? <verse eid="1CO 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30"/>Male eini rang khomin itho mo azoratina chipumin ei tân ngâi? <verse eid="1CO 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31"/>Ka lâibungngei le sarnungei, nîngtin thina ko tong ngâi! nangnia inpâkna ko dôn ha, ei Pumapa Jisua Khrista leh ei ringnun inzomna han mi minlang ngâi ani. <verse eid="1CO 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32"/>Miriem tho ngâi vaia Ephesia “ram sarângngei” insuolpui ki nînchu, kei rangin imo ânlâp ranga? Hanchu, mithi ngei ha aringin kaithoiin an omloi rangin chu senkhat ngei ti ngâi anghan, “Tho sâk ei ta, lei buong rei u, nangtûka ei thi rang ani zoi sikin.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:32: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 22:13">Isa 22:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33"/>Mo no roi. “Champui saloi ngeiin nunchan asa an siet ngâi.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34"/>Nin rietnangei adika han hongkîr nôk ungla, male nunsietaka nin omna ngâi lamngei ha mak roi. Nin lâia mi senkhat chu Pathien rietna reng nin dônloi sikin nin inzakna ranga mahi ki ti ani.<verse eid="1CO 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Inthoinôk takpum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35"/>Tumakhatin, “Inmo mithi ngei hah aringin kaithoi an om rang? Kho anga takpum mo an dôn rang?” Tiin a rekel thei. <verse eid="1CO 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36"/>Nangma amo! Pila sachi ni ling hah athi bak nônchu mông ngâi mak ngah. <verse eid="1CO 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37"/>Male na sachi ling khom hah a takpum la om rangin ling mak chea, aramal samsâi kêng nu tuh ngâi duo, bu ramal mini aninônchu chimu dang mini khom ani thei kêng. <verse eid="1CO 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38"/>Pathien'n a nuom lam angtakin chimu tin takpum a min pêla; ama'n chimu tin an takpum rang chit a pêk ngei ngâi ani.<verse eid="1CO 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39"/>Iring parânngei taksa nâm hih in-ang suo maka; munisingei taksa adang, sângei taksa adang, vângei taksa adanga, male ngangei taksa adang ani.<verse eid="1CO 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40"/>Male invân takpumngei le pilchung takpumngei khom aoma; invân takpumngei mêlsana adang ania, pilchung takpumngei mêlsana adang ani. <verse eid="1CO 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41"/>Nisa khom amêlsana adanga, tha mêlsana adang, ârsingei mêlsana khom adang sa; ârsingei lâia khom an mêlsana ajât dadangngei aom ani.<verse eid="1CO 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42"/>Mithi ngei aringin an inthoinôk tika aom rang chang chu hih anghin ani. Takpum hih phûmin aom tika chu ma hih monthei ania, kaithoiin aom lechu montheiloi nîng atih. <verse eid="1CO 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43"/>Phûmin aom han chu mêlsietak le râtloi tak nîng a ta; inthoinôkin aom lechu enhoitak le râttak nîng atih. <verse eid="1CO 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44"/>Phûmin aom han chu taksatienga takpum nîng a ta; kaithoiin aom lechu rathatienga takpum nîng atih. Taksatienga takpum aom sikin rathatienga takpum khom aom rang ani. <verse eid="1CO 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45"/>Pathien lekhabu'n atia, “Miriem masatak, Adam, chu miringin sin ania”; Anûktaka Adam hih chu ringna-pêk Ratha ani. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Aph 2:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46"/>Rathatienga hah ajuong om bak nimaka, taksatienga hah ajuong om baka, masuole kêng rathatienga hah ajuong om ani. <verse eid="1CO 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47"/>Adam masatak hah pila sin, pil renga hong ania; Adam inikna hah chu invân renga juong ani. <verse eid="1CO 15:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48"/>Pil ta ngei chu pila sinpu hah an phuoa; invân ta ngei chu invân renga juongpu hah an phuo ani. <verse eid="1CO 15:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49"/>Pila sinpu miriem phuona ênsil anghan, masikin invân renga miriem phuona khom ei lan sil<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:49: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ênsil rang; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngei an dôn chu </char><char style="fq">insil rei u.</char></note> rang ani.<verse eid="1CO 15:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50"/>Lâibung le sarnungei, “Taksa le thisen hin Pathien Rêngram luo thei no nia, thithei hin thitheiloina hah luo thei no ni,” ti hih ki tina ani.<verse eid="1CO 15:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51-52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51-52"/>Chongtak inthup hi rangâi roi: Ei rêngin chu lei thi riei no ih, aniatachu bekul nûktaka ahôn ring lehan, chomoltên, mitmisim kongkârin ei rêngin inthûlin om ei tih. Bekul ânring tikin chu mithi ngei khom thi nôk khâiloi rangin kaithoiin om an ta, male eini khom inthûlin om ei tih zoi. <verse eid="1CO 15:51-52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53"/>Thithei hih thitheiloiin thûlin om ngêt a ta; athi ngâi khom hi athi ngâiloiin inthûlin om ngêt atih. <verse eid="1CO 15:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54"/>Masikin hi thithei hih thitheiloiin thûlin aom lechu, hanchu Pathien lekhabua mizieka om hah hong tung tatak atih zoi: “Thina hih sietminmang ani zoia; motorna hih ânthôtphar zoi!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:54: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Isa 25:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55"/>“O Thina, no motorna hih khonmo aom zoi?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:55: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 13:14">Hos 13:14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:55">O Thina, ni minna theina ranga sinthotheina hih khonmo aom zoi?”<verse eid="1CO 15:55"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56"/>Thinân minna theina ranga sinthotheina chu sietna renga aman ngâi, male sietna sinthotheina chu Balam renga aman ani. <verse eid="1CO 15:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57"/>Hannirese ei Pumapa Jisua Khrista jâra motorna mi pêkpu Pathien kôm râisânchong om rese!<verse eid="1CO 15:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58"/>Masikin ko moroitak lâibungngei le sarnungei, adet le ngîrtitin inding roi. Pumapa ta ranga nin sintho hah ningsiettakin sin tit ungla, Pumapa chuonsin hih mangmunboi chang tet ngâi mak, ti nin riet sikin.<verse eid="1CO 15:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16"/>
  <para style="s">Iempu-champuingei ranga chôiruol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1"/>Atûn chu, Judea rama Pathien mingei ranga chôiruol chungroi nin miziek anghan. Galatia koiindangngei kôma ki ril anghan nangni khom lei tho ngêt sa roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:25">Rom 15:25</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 15:26">26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2"/>Masikin ko hong tika chôiruol rusuong anâng loina rangin, Pathienni tinna nin sisika nin sum suo ngei renga hah khâi ngêt ungla, male lei dar roi. <verse eid="1CO 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3"/>Ko hong suole, nin neinunpêkngei chôia Jerusalema se ranga nin thangpu ngei hah mêlinrietna lekhangei min chôiin tîr ngei ki tih. <verse eid="1CO 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4"/>Hanchu ke se ranga ânhoi ani vângin chu keima leh mên ruoipui thei an tih.<verse eid="1CO 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul mintuonangei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5"/>Macedonia rama ka chai rang anâng sikin Macedonia rama ka chai suo tika nin kôm hong ki tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Sin 19:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6"/>Nin kôm chu asôtzan om ki tih, phalbi sûng kai khom anithei, kho-kho tieng khom apêna ke sena ranga ma san thei nin tih. <verse eid="1CO 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7"/>Atûna selampala nangni mu rang chu nuom mu-unga; Pumapa'n aphal ngâiin chu nin kôm zora sôtzan châm rangin kên sabei ani.<verse eid="1CO 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8"/>Ephesi khuo hin Pentecosni tena chu ko om rang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Och 23:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9-11">Bal 16:9-11</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8-9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:8-10">Sin 19:8-10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9"/>Mahan mi doipungei tamtak om khom rese ngeia, sin roiinpuitak le sin kâmomtak ki sin theina ranga zorânchum tak aom ani.<verse eid="1CO 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10"/>Timothy hah nin lampui tieng a hong duoia anînchu, chi tet loia nin kâra aom theina rangin lamdon lei tho roi, keima angin Pumapa sin a tho ngâi sikin. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:17">1 Kor 4:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11"/>Tutên enkhum no rese ngeia, phûkdâitakin ko kôm a hong kîrnôk theina rangin san ngêt ungla mojôk roi; iempungei leh munkhata hong rangin ka lei sabei kêng.<verse eid="1CO 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12"/>Atûn, ei lâibungpa Apollos chungroi chu, iempu dangngei leh munkhatin nangni hongpan rangin ko mohôk tita, hannirese ama hih ma vêl hin chu hong rangin la minnuom phar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:12: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ama hih la minnuom phar nimaka; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mahi anrêngin Pathien lungdo ni let mak.</char></note> nimaka. Nikhomrese zorânchum a man tika hong atih.<verse eid="1CO 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Azoinataka chongbâingei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13"/>Intûngchienin om ungla, taksônna han inding det ungla, hâi ungla, râttakin om roi. <verse eid="1CO 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14"/>Nin sin ngei murdi hah lungkhamnân sin roi.<verse eid="1CO 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15"/>Ka lâibungngei le sarnungei, Stephanas le a inmingei chungroi hah nin rieta; anni ngei hah Achaia rama Khristien chang masatak an nia, Pathien mingei chuonsin ranga inpêk an nia, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:16">1 Kor 1:16</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="1CO 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16"/>ma anga mingei ruoipunina, le tumakhat khom anni leh chuonsin ngâingei le sintho ngâingei chu an chong jûi rangin nangni ke ngên ani.<verse eid="1CO 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17"/>Stephanas, Fortunatus, male Achaicus ngei; an hong hih asân ka râiasâna nin omloi khom indang loiin min donsûia <verse eid="1CO 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18"/>male nin mulungrîlngei nangni an minhar pe anghan, kei khom min minhar kêng. Ma anga mingei hih minlut rang rohoi piel an ni.<verse eid="1CO 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19"/>Asia ramhuol sûnga koiindangngei hin an chibaingei nangni an hong muthuona; Aquila le Priscilla male an ina koiindang inkhôm ngâingei hin Khristien chibaimûknangei nangni an hong muthuon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:2">Sin 18:2</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="1CO 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20"/>Hi muna iempungei murdi khom chibaimûknangei nangni an hong muthuon.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:20">Intum inthiengin inkhat le inkhat inchibai inlôm roi.<verse eid="1CO 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21"/>Keima ku kut lelên mahi ki miziek ani: <char style="sig">Paul renga chibaingei hi.</char><verse eid="1CO 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22"/>Tukhom Pumapa lungkham mu loi ngei chu an chunga khomâksâmna om rese!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:22">
    <char style="tl">Marana tha</char> Ei Pumapa, a juong!<verse eid="1CO 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23"/>Pumapa Jisua moroina hah nin kôm om rese.<verse eid="1CO 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24"/>Khrista Jisua sika nangni ku lungkhamna chu nin rênga nin kôm om rese.<verse eid="1CO 16:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16"/>
</usx>
